+See also: [Gelman Visualizing Sound](/docs/foundations/tools/instruments/sounds-bougies/gelman-visualizing-sound), [Van Buren Sound](/docs/foundations/tools/instruments/sounds-bougies/van-buren), [Suprapubic Catheter](/docs/foundations/tools/biomaterials/urinary-catheters/suprapubic-catheter), [Perineal Bookwalter (Jordan)](/docs/foundations/tools/instruments/retractors/perineal-bookwalter), and [Flexible Cystoscope](/docs/foundations/tools/instruments/endoscopy/flexible-cystoscope).
 
